
 fillzenodousage - Fill table 'gdexzenodo' from Zenodo metrics.

 Retrieves Zenodo usage info for GDEX-published datasets and inserts
 records into the 'gdexzenodo' table in PostgreSQL database 'rdadb'.

 USAGE:
   fillzenodousage [-b] -s DatasetShortNames
                   (-m MonthList | -N NumberDays | -y YearList)

 OPTIONS:

   -s DatasetShortNames   (required)
        Gather usage info for the given dataset short names.

   One of the following time-range options is required:

   -m MonthList
        Gather usage info for the given months.
        Month format: YYYY-MM (e.g. 2024-01).

   -N NumberDays
        Gather usage info for the most recent NumberDays days.

   -y YearList
        Gather usage info for the given years.
        Year format: YYYY (e.g. 2024).

   -b   Run in background mode (log to file only, no terminal output).

 EXAMPLE:
   fillzenodousage -s ds083.2 -y 2024
